---
layout: base
meta:
  title: Login | Bible Reading Plans Archive
  description: Login to see your progress.
---

<main class="mx-auto w-full p-3 md:w-6/12 lg:w-4/12" x-data="login">
    <div class="alert flex flex-col text-left items-start mb-2" x-show="registered" x-cloak>
        <div class="flex gap-2">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewbox="0 0 24 24" class="stroke-info shrink-0 w-6 h-6">
            <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
        </svg>
        
            <span x-text="registeredMessage"></span>
            </div>
            <div>
            <div tabindex="0" class="collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-200"> 
                <div class="collapse-title text-sm">
                    What is a "Magic Link"?
                </div>
                <div class="collapse-content text-xs"> 
                    <p>
                        A Magic Link is a way to login that does not require a username or password.
You put your email in, we send you a Magic Link, you click or tap it, and you are taken back to the site magically logged in.
No more forgetting and resetting passwords. No additional user data needed or collected.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="alert alert-error flex" x-show="error" x-cloak>
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="stroke-current shrink-0 h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 14l2-2m0 0l2-2m-2 2l-2-2m2 2l2 2m7-2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
        <span x-text="errorMessage"></span>
    </div>
    <form class="flex flex-col gap-3" @submit.prevent="submit">
        <div class="form-control">
            <label for="email">Email:</label>
            <input type="email" name="email" id="email" required="required"/>
        </div>
       {# <div class="form-control">
            <label for="password">Password:</label>
            <input type="password" name="password" id="password" required="required"/>
        </div>
        <div class="form-control flex">
            <label class="label cursor-pointer">
                <span class="label-text">Login</span>
                <input type="radio" name="type" class="radio" value="login" checked/>
            </label>
            <label class="label cursor-pointer">
                <span class="label-text">Rgister</span>
                <input type="radio" name="type" class="radio" value="register"/>
            </label>
        </div>#}
        <div class="form-control">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Login</button>
        </form>
    </main>